  "description": "The text 'free blanket' is mapped onto the visual entity 'dog_wearing_headdress'. The meme implies that the dog (representing a Native American) is receiving a 'free blanket' (a symbol of colonial 'gifts' or coercion), creating an analogical mapping where the dog is portrayed as the recipient of this symbolic offering. This mapping is part of the racist trope that portrays Native Americans as grateful for colonial oppression.",
